    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d165">

                <pb facs="0278" n="162" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg162"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.21/275.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Thomson to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 8, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>It affords me much satisfaction to report that the treaty has been approved
                    without amendment by the Colombian Congress.</p>
                <p>When will it be submitted to the Senate?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
